tireland.ie/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Ireland_Wolves_vs_Bangladesh-_5th_May_2019__22-scaled-1-1200x800.jpg 1200w, https://cricketireland.ie/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Ireland_Wolves_vs_Bangladesh-_5th_May_2019__22-scaled-1-600x400.jpg 600w" data-sizes="(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px" /></figure></section><section id="brxe-wbgfzw" class="brxe-section"><div id="brxe-nndgnx" class="brxe-container"><a id="brxe-aoxrhp" class="brxe-text-link" href="javascript:history.back();"><span class="icon"><i class="fas fa-arrow-left-long"></i></span><span class="text">back</span></a><div id="brxe-sgstdp" class="brxe-block"><h1 id="brxe-ibpxhn" class="brxe-heading">Fixtures and squad announced for new Ireland Wolves tour; initial Emerging Contracts confirmed</h1><div id="brxe-mdizem" class="brxe-text-basic">DUBLIN – Cricket Ireland today announced a new tour for the Ireland Wolves in February 2020, and confirmed the first round of Emerging Player Contracts for 2020.The Ireland Wolves is&hellip;</div></div><div id="brxe-rpaykl" class="brxe-block brx-grid"><div class="brxe-div date-links"><div id="brxe-cbfbij" class="brxe-div date-links__category"><span id="brxe-nctmuc" class="brxe-text-link date-links__type">January 30, 2020</span><span class="brxe-text-link"><a href="https://cricketireland.ie/category/international/">International</a></span><span class="brxe-text-link date-links__type"></span></div><div class="brxe-div icon-links"><ul id="brxe-tnugbi" class="brxe-post-sharing"><li title="Share on WhatsApp" ><a class="whatsapp" href="https://api.whatsapp.com/send?text=*Fixtures%20and%20squad%20announced%20for%20new%20Ireland%20Wolves%20tour%3B%20initial%20Emerging%20Contracts%20confirmed*+https%3A%2F%2Fcricketireland.ie%2Fnews%2Ffixtures-and-squad-announced-for-new-ireland-wolves-tour-initial-emerging-contracts-confirmed%2F" rel="nofollow" aria-label="WhatsApp"><svg version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 512 512" fill="#000" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/19